Tremulous Revamped (Windows x64)
================================

Play: run Tremulous.exe.

4K textures (optional): download both tremulous-revamped-hd-textures zips
from the same GitHub release and unzip them into this folder, so you get an
"hd" folder next to Tremulous.exe.

base/ holds the original Tremulous 1.1 content (see base/COPYING, base/CC
and base/README.txt).
Source code: https://github.com/MeepingsCorner/Tremulous-Revamped (this port);
the original Tremulous code it is ported from: https://github.com/darklegion/tremulous-legacy
